---
// Who We Are intro section.
---

<section class="py-32 px-6 md:px-12 bg-white text-brand-dark" id="about">
    <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
        <div class="mb-20 gsap-reveal">
            <span
                class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest border-b-2 border-brand-dark pb-2"
                >Who We Are</span
            >
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-24">
            <div class="gsap-reveal">
                <h2
                    class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tighter"
                >
                    Shaping how organisations are seen, understood, and
                    remembered.
                </h2>
                <a
                    href="/about"
                    class="interactive hidden lg:inline-block border-2 border-brand-dark text-brand-dark hover:bg-brand-dark hover:text-white px-8 py-4 mt-12 rounded-full text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-300"
                    >About Us</a
                >
            </div>
            <div
                class="gsap-reveal text-xl md:text-2xl font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-800"
            >
                <p class="mb-8">
                    Reputation is no longer built through one channel - it is
                    shaped through media coverage, leadership visibility,
                    investor confidence, employee conversations, search results,
                    social presence, websites, and every digital interaction
                    that influences perception.
                </p>
                <p>
                    ChimpzLab brings these touchpoints together through
                    integrated communications, strategic storytelling and
                    digital execution - helping brands become clearer to their
                    audiences, more visible in their markets, and more trusted
                    by the people who matter.
                </p>
                <a
                    href="/booking-form"
                    class="interactive inline-block lg:hidden border-2 border-brand-dark text-brand-dark hover:bg-brand-dark hover:text-white px-8 py-4 mt-12 rounded-full text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-300"
                    >About Us</a
                >
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
